WEBVTT

00:00:02.287 --> 00:00:05.599
I... I don't want that guy to take you!

00:00:06.621 --> 00:00:08.109
Archie!

00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:15.489
For that bastard to take you...
From the first time I saw you, Candy, I...

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:16.642
Stop it!

00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:22.062
Please, stop it!

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:30.858
Realizing that her beloved Archie likes Candy,
Annie was shocked.

00:00:36.113 --> 00:00:44.265
Moreover, Eliza found out the secret
that Annie was raised in Pony's home.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:52.515
Archie comforted Annie's hurt feelings.

00:00:57.511 --> 00:01:04.871
And finally, Candy and Annie managed to
mend their lost friendship.

00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:11.777
A wondrous encounter.

00:01:59.636 --> 00:02:01.761
-Can you manage?
-I'm okay.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.564
-I'll walk the rest by myself.
-Alright. Take care.

00:02:05.165 --> 00:02:06.545
Thanks...

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:35.674
A thief?

00:02:42.087 --> 00:02:43.594
Te... Terry?

00:02:45.382 --> 00:02:47.708
Terry, what happened to you?

00:02:49.555 --> 00:02:54.273
So this is Tarzan-girl's room?
That guy made a mistake...

00:02:56.163 --> 00:03:00.283
Blood!
Terry, you have wounds all over your body!

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.944
What have you gotten yourself into?

00:03:06.131 --> 00:03:07.656
I got some.

00:03:07.691 --> 00:03:08.918
Just a stupid fight.

00:03:09.543 --> 00:03:11.611
They got you pretty well.

00:03:12.027 --> 00:03:14.439
They were a real bunch of ninjas.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.851
However, a passer-by came to my help.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.417
He also brought me back to this place.

00:03:23.401 --> 00:03:25.387
You reek of alcohol, Terry!

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:26.751
Can you tell?

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.465
You punk! You break all the rules
but it's never enough for you!

00:03:37.004 --> 00:03:39.211
-They got you with a knife.
-Yeah...

00:03:39.246 --> 00:03:40.897
I'd better stop the bleeding.

00:03:42.964 --> 00:03:46.963
He's a bloody mess... just why did he
have to fight in the first place?

00:03:47.608 --> 00:03:50.428
After all, he's a son of a rich and famous nobleman.

00:03:52.196 --> 00:03:54.222
You're hurting me! Watch what you're doing!

00:03:55.061 --> 00:03:57.614
You don't get to complain while I'm tending your wounds!

00:03:57.615 --> 00:03:58.814
Ouch!

00:03:58.849 --> 00:04:02.208
Are you paying me back for what I did
to you before, Tarzan lady?

00:04:02.243 --> 00:04:04.085
I'm freckled Tarzan.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.108
You made it up yourself, don't forget that!

00:04:06.755 --> 00:04:10.043
You have good memory. That's right.
Freckled Tarzan.

00:04:10.413 --> 00:04:11.435
Oh crap!

00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:16.957
Sorry. I'll leave as soon as I pull myself together.

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:19.793
If that guy hadn't mixed up the buildings,
I wouldn't have entered your room...

00:04:19.828 --> 00:04:21.867
Don't talk. You'll upset your wounds.

00:04:22.102 --> 00:04:25.297
He's all sweaty... maybe he's having a fever?

00:04:27.051 --> 00:04:29.503
What should I do?
I can't just leave him like this.

00:04:30.527 --> 00:04:36.083
He needs some medicine. They keep some in the
nurse's office, but I can't simply ask sisters for it.

00:04:36.667 --> 00:04:38.301
Is there a better solution...?

00:04:39.847 --> 00:04:40.821
Alright!

00:04:51.574 --> 00:04:54.557
Terry! I'm going out to buy some medicine for you!

00:04:55.232 --> 00:04:57.773
Don't do anything stupid!
Just leave it like this!

00:04:59.467 --> 00:05:01.792
You're asking me to leave a wounded person?

00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:05.525
You're lucky that I'm not the kind of lady
who faints at the first sight of blood!

00:05:05.744 --> 00:05:06.742
Candy.

00:05:07.366 --> 00:05:09.194
Okay? Just lay still.

00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:13.819
Candy!

00:05:15.671 --> 00:05:16.663
Bye!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.496
She does such unreasonable things...

00:06:11.568 --> 00:06:13.795
Most stores are closed already.

00:06:14.297 --> 00:06:17.775
Only the bars are still open.

00:06:18.506 --> 00:06:23.454
He-hey, lil' lady...
wanna help me finish this off?

00:06:25.395 --> 00:06:28.443
I wonder if Terry was drinking
at a place like this.

00:06:29.159 --> 00:06:31.581
Just where is the pharmacy...

00:06:35.651 --> 00:06:37.188
That's...!

00:06:40.745 --> 00:06:42.089
You! Wait a second!

00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:43.802
Candy!
You're Candy, aren't you?

00:06:46.081 --> 00:06:49.754
Don't try to random-guess my name!
You're not my friend!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.677
It's me.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.899
Have you forgotten me, Candy?

00:07:01.369 --> 00:07:03.701
It's me! Have you forgotten me, Candy?

00:07:04.851 --> 00:07:06.063
Mr. Albert?

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.783
He doesn't have a beard, but that voice...

00:07:08.812 --> 00:07:10.136
And that smile!

00:07:11.235 --> 00:07:12.724
Mr. Albert!

00:07:16.285 --> 00:07:17.745
It's been a long time, Candy!

00:07:17.986 --> 00:07:20.653
Really, Mr. Albert, it was!
It really was!

00:07:21.913 --> 00:07:24.548
When I went to London,
I thought I'd never meet him again.

00:07:24.673 --> 00:07:26.380
But now, he's so close to me!

00:07:26.673 --> 00:07:27.956
Mr. Albert!

00:07:38.872 --> 00:07:42.284
Now, now, don't cry, Candy!
Let me see your face!

00:07:42.859 --> 00:07:44.911
You've turned into a real beauty!

00:07:45.252 --> 00:07:46.976
Mr. Albert, you did too!

00:07:48.313 --> 00:07:50.693
I've turned beautiful?
Why, I'm glad to hear that!

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:54.829
So you've shaved your beard?
I thought you were an old man!

00:07:55.039 --> 00:07:58.048
Come on!
Actually, I'm still in my twenties.

00:07:58.083 --> 00:08:02.494
I'm sorry for calling out your name back there,
but it's the best way to confront someone.

00:08:02.766 --> 00:08:03.981
Confront?

00:08:04.093 --> 00:08:09.782
Yes. Since I know these things, and I'm good
with animals, I got myself a job at the zoo.

00:08:10.002 --> 00:08:12.492
When my animals were caught, they were taken
to the London zoo.

00:08:15.633 --> 00:08:19.357
Instead of parting with my animals,
I went along with them.

00:08:19.539 --> 00:08:21.364
So that's why you know how to raise animals.

00:08:21.526 --> 00:08:24.472
Yes. They are in the Blue River zoo right now.

00:08:24.507 --> 00:08:27.768
It's a small zoo, but a very nice one, Candy.

00:08:27.803 --> 00:08:30.775
Then, next time we're allowed out,
I'll come to visit you.

00:08:30.955 --> 00:08:33.774
I'll be waiting.
However, meeting you in this place...

00:08:33.896 --> 00:08:36.693
That's right, this is London, not America...

00:08:37.201 --> 00:08:40.516
If I hadn't snuck out to buy medicine...
Medicine?

00:08:40.693 --> 00:08:43.065
-That's right, I have to buy medicine!
-Medicine?

00:08:43.184 --> 00:08:47.424
Is there a pharmacy somewhere near?
My friend was hurt, and it's an emergency!

00:08:47.572 --> 00:08:51.690
Hurt? There was one guy who was beaten up tonight...
Anyway, how is he doing?

00:08:51.901 --> 00:08:55.312
Not too well.
I'd better buy the medicine and hurry back!

00:08:55.313 --> 00:08:59.133
-I see. I know of a pharmacy, let's go there.
-Okay!

00:09:05.156 --> 00:09:06.676
I fell asleep.

00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:09.365
Looks like the bleeding stopped.

00:09:09.546 --> 00:09:12.879
She bound my leg so tightly.
That nosy freckled Tarzan girl.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.457
If I'm already this well,
I guess I can walk, too.

00:09:28.292 --> 00:09:29.917
Farewell, Candy!

00:09:41.704 --> 00:09:47.819
Say, Kurin, are you lonely now that you're
at St. Paul academy? Want to come to my zoo?

00:09:50.633 --> 00:09:52.745
Kurin is doing well on his own!

00:09:52.986 --> 00:09:54.756
Is that so? I'm glad to hear that.

00:09:54.757 --> 00:09:57.945
Mr. Albert, I want to talk to you more, but...

00:09:58.754 --> 00:10:00.340
...you'd better hurry with the medicine.

00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:02.717
I'll come to see you during the holidays!

00:10:03.747 --> 00:10:05.354
I'll be waiting for you, Candy.

00:10:07.591 --> 00:10:08.919
Now, Candy!

00:10:09.033 --> 00:10:10.445
Thank you, Mr. Albert.

00:10:11.951 --> 00:10:14.527
-Mr. Albert, goodbye!
-Goodbye, Candy!

00:10:19.712 --> 00:10:21.092
Good night, Candy!

00:10:24.009 --> 00:10:26.829
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Albert is a groovy guy.

00:10:35.855 --> 00:10:37.069
Terry?

00:10:37.207 --> 00:10:39.216
He's... He's gone.

00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:43.715
I went through all the trouble to buy medicine
for him, but he ran away.

00:10:43.882 --> 00:10:46.448
He even left without thanking me...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:53.200
I finally met Mr. Albert, but I was in such a hurry
to get back that I didn't speak properly to him!

00:10:53.374 --> 00:10:55.636
Terry, you're such a pain in the ass!

00:10:55.671 --> 00:10:58.958
Why did I cast pearls before a swine like you!

00:11:01.048 --> 00:11:03.480
Candy? What are you doing in there?

00:11:11.012 --> 00:11:12.003
Candy?

00:11:15.545 --> 00:11:16.552
You're asleep?

00:11:19.175 --> 00:11:20.502
I see, she talks in sleep.

00:11:27.494 --> 00:11:28.613
Candice.

00:11:29.408 --> 00:11:32.479
If you're pretending that you're asleep,
at least take your shoes off.

00:11:37.309 --> 00:11:38.555
Caught me.

00:11:38.966 --> 00:11:41.623
But I'm lucky it wasn't sister Gray.

00:11:45.153 --> 00:11:46.906
And that Terry...

00:11:49.129 --> 00:11:54.001
His actions are really...
But thanks to him, I got the chance to meet Mr. Albert.

00:11:56.562 --> 00:11:59.626
If he was able to move, I guess
I don't have to worry about his wounds.

00:11:59.865 --> 00:12:00.863
Terry.

00:12:16.124 --> 00:12:18.482
I haven't seen him in the hall.

00:12:18.878 --> 00:12:20.932
Terry is nowhere to be found.

00:12:21.172 --> 00:12:23.466
And there are no rumours of anyone being hurt.

00:12:26.531 --> 00:12:30.323
I don't believe he had no reason to come to my room.

00:12:30.545 --> 00:12:33.734
Say, Annie, what kind of sports were you into?
While you were in Pony's home?

00:12:34.018 --> 00:12:36.163
Weren't you in some sports club?

00:12:36.383 --> 00:12:38.298
But I'm not really good...

00:12:38.486 --> 00:12:42.127
-You can't tell unless you try!
-But...

00:12:42.198 --> 00:12:46.351
Eliza. She is pestering Annie
because she isn't good at sports.

00:12:46.739 --> 00:12:51.104
-Archery sounds good for you.
-That's right, give it a try, Annie!

00:12:51.294 --> 00:12:53.173
If you want to join a club, we'll
inform you about the procedures.

00:12:53.357 --> 00:12:55.498
-Annie!
-Candy!

00:12:56.466 --> 00:13:00.198
I see, after all, she gets along better with
the girl from Pony's home than with us.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.987
We don't deal with such nasties.

00:13:03.335 --> 00:13:06.636
Say, Louise, when you said nasties, you meant us?

00:13:06.721 --> 00:13:07.859
Yes, that's right.

00:13:08.061 --> 00:13:09.654
I see, I'm so glad!

00:13:09.689 --> 00:13:13.401
Don't join our club then! We'd rather be nasty
than disgusting!

00:13:13.588 --> 00:13:15.162
Don't you think that, Louise?

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:22.999
Thank you.

00:13:23.136 --> 00:13:25.710
I don't want you to worry about Eliza and the others!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:29.116
I don't mind being called
"girl from Pony's home" anymore!

00:13:29.151 --> 00:13:30.623
I don't have to hide it anymore!

00:13:30.658 --> 00:13:32.393
That's the spirit, Annie!

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:38.729
Candy, Archie and Stear said they'll be waiting
for you in the boys' lab during the recess.

00:13:38.947 --> 00:13:40.371
Archie and Stear?

00:13:41.067 --> 00:13:42.513
I wonder what is this about...

00:13:42.548 --> 00:13:45.523
Who knows... They only wanted me to
transfer the message to you.

00:13:45.614 --> 00:13:49.097
Annie, it'll go just fine!
With Archie!

00:13:49.792 --> 00:13:51.555
Candy, you...

00:13:51.872 --> 00:13:56.720
"Keep off the girls"
(I'm not sure if this was intentional, but LMAO)

00:14:01.668 --> 00:14:03.125
The coast is clear!

00:14:08.866 --> 00:14:11.523
-Hi, Candy, Annie.
-Hurry!

00:14:23.332 --> 00:14:27.965
Well now, everyone, I'd like to
present you my newest invetion!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.429
What did you invent?

00:14:30.874 --> 00:14:31.851
Well now.

00:14:32.047 --> 00:14:35.164
You'll see something nice!
Ta-dah!

00:14:35.788 --> 00:14:37.810
It's a flying carrier boat!

00:14:38.506 --> 00:14:40.551
What's that flying carrier-boat thing?

00:14:40.586 --> 00:14:43.713
Press the button on the device atop the table!

00:14:44.081 --> 00:14:44.833
This?

00:14:56.321 --> 00:14:57.613
It's flying!

00:15:04.928 --> 00:15:05.834
Incredible, isn't it?

00:15:06.045 --> 00:15:09.719
If you put a letter inside, it can take it
from the window of one room to another!

00:15:10.457 --> 00:15:13.085
It's pretty!
You're great, Stear!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:17.474
Because it's so quiet, you'll be able to
send messages to that nobleman without worry!

00:15:17.502 --> 00:15:18.629
Nobleman?

00:15:19.635 --> 00:15:24.683
Come to think of it, what happened to Terry
after he got beaten up the other day?

00:15:25.505 --> 00:15:28.109
I heard about this today.
But only that his leg was hurt.

00:15:29.102 --> 00:15:31.281
If he was wounded, maybe he went home?

00:15:31.885 --> 00:15:33.276
I'm glad. He'll be okay.

00:15:33.312 --> 00:15:34.614
Aaah - - Candy!

00:15:42.689 --> 00:15:45.297
Oh, no!
The boat is in pieces!

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:49.805
I... I'm sorry.

00:16:02.804 --> 00:16:04.908
I did something bad to Stear.

00:16:05.645 --> 00:16:09.835
And that Terry guy...
I wish he would come back to see me.

00:16:19.572 --> 00:16:22.203
Seeing a girl lying in grass is such a nice sight.

00:16:23.437 --> 00:16:24.691
Terry!

00:16:27.902 --> 00:16:30.510
You've recovered so quickly!
I'm glad!

00:16:30.576 --> 00:16:34.523
You don't need to worry about me.
Freckled Tarzan.

00:16:34.676 --> 00:16:39.795
You're so stubborn! I'm Candy!
I went out the other day to buy medicine for you...

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:43.840
Why, you break the rules too!
You went out without permission.

00:16:43.938 --> 00:16:48.682
I'm not kidding... how can you say that!
I did that for your sake!

00:16:49.563 --> 00:16:51.772
And now you're going to ask something
in return for your favor?

00:16:55.588 --> 00:16:56.584
It's...

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.750
...such a frigtening expression.

00:16:59.262 --> 00:17:00.112
So cold.

00:17:05.735 --> 00:17:08.176
I'm not going to ask anything in return!

00:17:08.211 --> 00:17:11.226
Not even if you beg me to!
Farewell!

00:17:13.754 --> 00:17:16.569
What a piece of work he is!
Why is he so fickle?

00:17:37.083 --> 00:17:42.876
Well then, everyone, let's show our gratitude
to our Lord by offering a prayer.

00:17:48.731 --> 00:17:52.561
It's even in the soup...
the reflection of his hateful face.

00:17:52.719 --> 00:17:55.253
I thought that there was a gentle side to him.

00:17:55.623 --> 00:18:00.197
He drinks and gets into fights...
I have no idea what's going through his mind.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.095
I've never met someone that strange before!

00:18:04.287 --> 00:18:06.231
Anyway, I won't bother with him anymore.

00:18:06.405 --> 00:18:08.763
If I happen upon him, I'll pretend we're strangers.

00:18:09.739 --> 00:18:10.972
Amen.

00:18:53.221 --> 00:18:57.445
Yeah, sunglasses... You'll find him in that shack
over there. He's on a break now.

00:18:57.624 --> 00:18:58.735
Thank you.

00:19:11.604 --> 00:19:16.136
So that's his office?
I thought it would've looked much better.

00:19:22.077 --> 00:19:23.245
Mr. Albert?

00:19:23.482 --> 00:19:25.178
-Mr. Albert!
-Come in!

00:19:26.026 --> 00:19:27.675
Boo, Mr. Albert!

00:19:30.142 --> 00:19:31.461
Te-Terry!

00:19:31.569 --> 00:19:32.462
Candy!

00:19:37.913 --> 00:19:39.745
What, you two know each other?

00:19:40.361 --> 00:19:42.716
Yes... we go to the same school.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:47.898
I love this! The two troublemakers of the
St. Paul academy have gathered in my shack!

00:19:47.933 --> 00:19:49.041
Troublemakers?

00:19:49.237 --> 00:19:53.576
Candy is being her normal self. You drank too
much the other day and picked a fight.

00:19:53.776 --> 00:19:56.558
That means... the man who helped Terry was...

00:19:56.697 --> 00:20:01.181
Yeah. If he didn't come to my help,
I would've fared much worse.

00:20:01.346 --> 00:20:02.706
It's just that...

00:20:03.159 --> 00:20:04.369
Just... what?

00:20:05.119 --> 00:20:09.255
You mistook the girls' ward for boys' ward
when you carried me back to school.

00:20:09.566 --> 00:20:11.108
And then you barged into my room.

00:20:11.522 --> 00:20:13.225
So that was girls' ward?

00:20:13.226 --> 00:20:15.228
When I realized that you were the wounded person
Candy was talking about,

00:20:15.446 --> 00:20:17.618
...I ran together with her to buy medicine for you.

00:20:18.637 --> 00:20:19.498
I'm sorry.

00:20:19.755 --> 00:20:22.798
But you saved Terry, Mr. Albert! You must be tough!

00:20:23.957 --> 00:20:26.454
Nah, I just have more experience in fighting!

00:20:27.551 --> 00:20:29.966
That means, you used to be a troublemaker as well?

00:20:30.001 --> 00:20:31.139
I still am!

00:20:31.221 --> 00:20:32.836
Perhaps I'll stay that way forever!

00:20:33.004 --> 00:20:33.839
Me too!

00:20:39.478 --> 00:20:40.829
Terry is laughing.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.646
Light from the window reflects so beautifully
in his gentle smile.

00:20:45.491 --> 00:20:46.564
I'm so glad!

00:20:47.073 --> 00:20:51.170
But... I swore to God that I'd forget everything
about Terry.

00:20:51.953 --> 00:20:52.900
And yet...

00:20:53.651 --> 00:20:54.601
And yet...

00:20:56.666 --> 00:21:02.101
Without really knowing the reason,
Terry came to stay in her thoughts.

00:21:16.047 --> 00:21:20.555
To be continued.
